		(property "Description" "Board2 (comms/relay board, plain Pico 2 / RP2350, no Wi-Fi used - symbol/footprint kept as RPi_Pico:Pico, Value field left as legacy 'Pico 2 W' text): 5 dedicated UART slot links to puzzle modules (GP8-GP17, J1-J5), I2C0 to shared-parameter OLED (GP0/GP1, J7), shared-parameter GPIO (GP2-GP7, J8), dedicated UART+power link to Board1/master-timer board via J9 (GP18=M_TX, GP19=M_RX). Powered from Board1 via J9 Pin3 (VIN_5V) into VSYS (pin39); own USB VBUS (pin40) is no_connect since Board1 supplies power."
			(at 149.86 76.2 0)
			(hide yes)
